# Zerorez Collections Performance Hub

- Project: standalone browser AR dashboard (monorepo pnpm: apps/web, packages/shared).
- Language: Strict TypeScript across the repo. UI copy in English; code, identifiers, and commits in English.
- No Google Sheets, googleapis, Workspace OAuth, or backend required. Excel is parsed in the browser; state persists in IndexedDB.
- Delinquency stages and insights are calculated only with packages/shared functions.
- Stage windows: 0–14, 15–29, 30–48, 49–63, 64+.
- Do not log or print customer PII. Do not commit credentials or real Excel files.
- Every new business rule ships with a Vitest test.
- Design: follow reference/zerorez-crm.html (colors, hierarchy, copy). Light/dark themes.
